      "body": "Third quarter 2026 results: EPS: ₹5.39 (up from ₹3.85 in 3Q 2025). Revenue: ₹10.7b (up 9.6% from 3Q 2025). Net income: ₹898.0m (up 41% from 3Q 2025). Profit margin: 8.4% (up from 6.5% in 3Q 2025). The increase in margin was driven by higher revenue. Over the last 3 years on average, earnings per share has increased by 20% per year but the company’s share price has fallen by 7% per year, which means it is significantly lagging earnings.",
